Description: Wild OS Terminal
 Terminal is the Wild OS command line app, laid out like Windows
 Terminal: tabs in the title bar with a menu of profiles beside them,
 split panes, and settings that look and work like the rest of Wild OS.
 It opens with the Homebrew colour scheme (green on black) and Cascadia
 Mono, and also ships Wild OS, Campbell, One Half and Solarized schemes.
 The terminal itself is QTermWidget, the emulator LXQt's terminal uses.
